# Legends of the Twins — class features of the Mariner (pp.15-16) and the Knight of the Divine Hammer (pp.17-18).
Bonus Feat	KEY:Mariner ~ Bonus Feat	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 1st, 5th, 10th, 15th and 20th level, a bonus feat from this list (all prerequisites still apply, ability scores and base attack bonus included): Alertness, Combat Expertise (Improved Disarm, Improved Feint, Improved Trip), Combat Reflexes, Dodge (Mobility), Exotic Weapon Proficiency, Improved Initiative, Lucky, Point Blank Shot (Far Shot, Precise Shot, Rapid Shot), Power Attack (Cleave, Great Cleave, Improved Bull Rush, Improved Overrun, Improved Sunder), Quick Draw, Quick-Thinking, Toughness, Weapon Finesse, Weapon Focus. Lucky and Quick-Thinking are this book's own feats. The app gives a free feat choice at these levels and does not restrict it to the list; pick from it.	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
Sailor Lore	KEY:Mariner ~ Sailor Lore	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A sailor lore check, with a bonus of mariner level + Intelligence modifier, to know something relevant about local people or history, far places, or strange superstitions; what it turns up is not necessarily true. You cannot take 10 or 20 on it. DCs: 10 commonly known, gossip most people have heard; 20 known to select groups; 25 known only to a few, spoken in whispers; 30 unknown to the vast majority, long forgotten.	SOURCEPAGE:p.15-16
Seamanship +1	KEY:Mariner ~ Seamanship +1	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on all Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st level, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th.	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
Seamanship +2	KEY:Mariner ~ Seamanship +2	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on all Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st level, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th.	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
