Seamanship +5	KEY:Mariner ~ Seamanship +5	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on all Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st level, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th.	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
Dirty Strike +1d4	KEY:Mariner ~ Dirty Strike +1d4	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, as a full-round action, a single melee attack that deals +1d4 extra damage; +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The extra damage is the weapon's own kind (nonlethal if the attack's is), is not multiplied on a critical hit, and does not affect creatures without a discernible anatomy or immune to critical hits (constructs, oozes, plants, undead).	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
Dirty Strike +2d4	KEY:Mariner ~ Dirty Strike +2d4	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, as a full-round action, a single melee attack that deals +1d4 extra damage; +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The extra damage is the weapon's own kind (nonlethal if the attack's is), is not multiplied on a critical hit, and does not affect creatures without a discernible anatomy or immune to critical hits (constructs, oozes, plants, undead).	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
