Back-to-Back +1	KEY:Mariner ~ Back-to-Back +1	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 4th level, while adjacent to an ally and fighting defensively, taking total defense or using Combat Expertise, a +1 dodge bonus to AC; +2 at 8th, +3 at 12th, +4 at 16th, +5 at 20th. Lost while you are denied your Dexterity bonus to AC, or if you or the ally move more than 5 feet away.	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
Back-to-Back +2	KEY:Mariner ~ Back-to-Back +2	CATEGORY:Mariner Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 4th level, while adjacent to an ally and fighting defensively, taking total defense or using Combat Expertise, a +1 dodge bonus to AC; +2 at 8th, +3 at 12th, +4 at 16th, +5 at 20th. Lost while you are denied your Dexterity bonus to AC, or if you or the ally move more than 5 feet away.	SOURCEPAGE:p.16
