Law of Istar	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Law of Istar	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) +1 circumstance bonus per Knight of the Divine Hammer level on Diplomacy and Gather Information checks made on official Istarian business.	SOURCEPAGE:p.17
Take Him Down	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Take Him Down	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 1st level, deal nonlethal damage instead of normal damage with no penalty on the attack roll, announced before rolling.	SOURCEPAGE:p.17
Favor +1	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Favor +1	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level: +1, +2 at 5th, +3 at 8th. Works as the noble's Favor (Dragonlance Campaign Setting p.51), calling on the upper ranks of the Divine Hammer and the priesthood of Paladine. It stacks with Favor from another class (such as noble), and the levels stack for how many favors may be called each week.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Favor +2	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Favor +2	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level: +1, +2 at 5th, +3 at 8th. Works as the noble's Favor (Dragonlance Campaign Setting p.51), calling on the upper ranks of the Divine Hammer and the priesthood of Paladine. It stacks with Favor from another class (such as noble), and the levels stack for how many favors may be called each week.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Favor +3	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Favor +3	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level: +1, +2 at 5th, +3 at 8th. Works as the noble's Favor (Dragonlance Campaign Setting p.51), calling on the upper ranks of the Divine Hammer and the priesthood of Paladine. It stacks with Favor from another class (such as noble), and the levels stack for how many favors may be called each week.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Smite Infidel (1st type)	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Smite Infidel (1st type)	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At 2nd level, choose a type of infidel: outsiders, spellcasters (creatures with levels in a spellcasting class), goblinoids, giants or undead. Once a day, one normal melee attack against a chosen infidel adds your Charisma bonus (if any) to the attack roll and 1 damage per Knight of the Divine Hammer level. Smiting a creature that is not a chosen infidel has no effect but uses the smite. At 4th, 6th, 8th and 10th level, choose another type or add one more use per day against an existing one. Works alongside favored enemy, smite evil and similar abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Smite Infidel (2nd type)	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Smite Infidel (2nd type)	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At 2nd level, choose a type of infidel: outsiders, spellcasters (creatures with levels in a spellcasting class), goblinoids, giants or undead. Once a day, one normal melee attack against a chosen infidel adds your Charisma bonus (if any) to the attack roll and 1 damage per Knight of the Divine Hammer level. Smiting a creature that is not a chosen infidel has no effect but uses the smite. At 4th, 6th, 8th and 10th level, choose another type or add one more use per day against an existing one. Works alongside favored enemy, smite evil and similar abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
