Smite Infidel (5th type)	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Smite Infidel (5th type)	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At 2nd level, choose a type of infidel: outsiders, spellcasters (creatures with levels in a spellcasting class), goblinoids, giants or undead. Once a day, one normal melee attack against a chosen infidel adds your Charisma bonus (if any) to the attack roll and 1 damage per Knight of the Divine Hammer level. Smiting a creature that is not a chosen infidel has no effect but uses the smite. At 4th, 6th, 8th and 10th level, choose another type or add one more use per day against an existing one. Works alongside favored enemy, smite evil and similar abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Coordinate +1	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Coordinate +1	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 3rd level: +1, +2 at 6th, +3 at 9th. Works as the noble's Coordinate (Dragonlance Campaign Setting p.52), and can also be used to help an ally in combat. Stacks with Coordinate from another class (such as noble).	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Coordinate +2	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Coordinate +2	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 3rd level: +1, +2 at 6th, +3 at 9th. Works as the noble's Coordinate (Dragonlance Campaign Setting p.52), and can also be used to help an ally in combat. Stacks with Coordinate from another class (such as noble).	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Coordinate +3	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Coordinate +3	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 3rd level: +1, +2 at 6th, +3 at 9th. Works as the noble's Coordinate (Dragonlance Campaign Setting p.52), and can also be used to help an ally in combat. Stacks with Coordinate from another class (such as noble).	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Valor of Istar	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Valor of Istar	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At 4th level, a +4 morale bonus against fear effects, and once a day as a free action immunity to fear for rounds equal to your Charisma bonus (if any).	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Might of Istar	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Might of Istar	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) At 7th level, once a day as a free action, a +4 morale bonus to Strength and Constitution for 3 + your Charisma bonus (if any) rounds.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
Glory of Istar	KEY:Knight of the Divine Hammer ~ Glory of Istar	CATEGORY:Knight of the Divine Hammer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) At 10th level, when you charge you add your Charisma bonus (if any) to all weapon damage rolls, and may make an Intimidate check against the opponent as a free action with a +4 morale bonus. Allies within 30 feet who see the charge gain a +4 morale bonus on saves against fear and +1 on all weapon damage rolls until your next turn.	SOURCEPAGE:p.18
